### HTTP Client (ekstensi "REST Client" VS Code / HTTP Client JetBrains)
@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Login mahasiswa (200)
# @name loginMhs1
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mhs1", "password": "Mahasiswa1#" }

###
@tokenMhs1 = {{loginMhs1.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin#2026" }

###
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Tanpa token (401)
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan

### 4. Mahasiswa membuat pengaduan (201)
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "Proyektor ruang C101 rusak", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "Proyektor tidak menyala sehingga perkuliahan terganggu." }

### 5. Mahasiswa membaca pengaduan orang lain (403)
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/3
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs1}}

### 6. Mahasiswa mengubah status (403)
PATCH {{base}}/api/pengaduan/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "selesai" }

### 7. Admin melihat semua (200)
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 8. Admin ubah status (200)
PATCH {{base}}/api/pengaduan/3/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "diproses" }

### 9. Field wajib kosong (400)
POST {{base}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMhs1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "", "kategori": "Fasilitas" }

### 10. ID tidak ditemukan (404)
GET {{base}}/api/pengaduan/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
